            "value" : "Browsers are excluded by default (YouTube videos and the like). New players scrobble until you exclude them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I permessi servono solo se il Now Playing di sistema non è disponibile e l'app usa AppleScript." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permissions are only needed when the system Now Playing isn't available and the app uses AppleScript."
